  "description": "<p>This Pride Rainbow Doormat offers a vibrant and welcoming touch to any home. Featuring colorful artwork inspired by inclusivity, love, and positivity, it adds personality and warmth to your decor. Designed for everyday use, this decorative floor mat is perfect for creating a cozy and inviting atmosphere.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features a bright and colorful Pride design with rainbow artwork.</li>\n<li>Soft and durable material ensures everyday comfort and lasting print.</li>\n<li>Adds personality and warmth to home decor with its vivid design.</li>\n<li>Suitable for both indoor and outdoor spaces.</li>\n<li>Perfect for creating an inclusive home aesthetic.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Porch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>rainbow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Rainbow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Text Input</td>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Rubber</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile doormat is ideal for front doors, entryways, patios, porches, apartments, dorms, classrooms, offices, and other indoor or outdoor spaces. It helps create a warm and inviting atmosphere for guests and family alike.</p>",
